WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.320
I've never told you this,

2
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.800
but I'd like you more with orange powder.

3
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.240
I've never told you, but I think bangs would suit you really well,

4
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.120
a hairstyle with a single strand of bangs like this.

5
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.560
(unclear) Thanks, dear, it's this Justin Bieber style, okay?

6
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.260
Very pretty.

7
00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.040
I think I'd like you a lot more

8
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.780
