11
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.080
Do you like it?

12
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.020
Do you agree with me that it's prettier this way?

13
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.820
You're already very pretty to me,

14
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:35.060
