18
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.540
if you had a couple of hairs on your chin.

19
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.240
Thanks, dear, I'm much prettier.

20
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.540
I think you'd be even prettier

21
00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:51.220
