31
00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:10.360
Bravo.

32
00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:11.380
Thank you.

33
00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:14.240
And I think a very, very sharply narrowed nose

34
00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.900
would suit you really well.

35
00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:21.500
I think you'd look much better with huge lashes.

36
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.160
This may sound strange,

37
00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:26.820
but I'm sure that missing a tooth would really suit you.

38
00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:29.060
I think you'd...

39
00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:29.720
Okay.

40
00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:32.320
For an even better look, I removed two teeth.

41
00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:36.220
I think you'd be the most beautiful in the world

42
00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.840
with a huge mole on your right cheek

43
00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.320
(unclear) and two hairs on it.

44
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.180
I completely agree with you.

45
00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:46.340
I think maybe it would even look really nice on you

46
00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.900
