47
00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.970
Dear, you're gorgeous.

48
00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:53.990
It's perfect.

49
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:55.230
(inaudible)

50
00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:58.650
(unclear) Oh, you don't look like yourself, what is this?

51
00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.830
I think it would be much prettier if you had a ponytail here.

52
00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:02.850
Okay.

53
00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:03.470
Here.

54
00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:04.590
Do you get it?

55
00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:06.210
We'll change it a little differently...

56
00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:08.010
Dear, now you're much prettier to me.

57
00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:09.670
And you're, dear, more beautiful to me than ever.

58
00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.110
Now we love each other much more.